### Feature Customer — UPDATE (PUT) / UPDATE (PATCH)
### Modalidad JWT + RBAC. `status` no se envía: el estado solo cambia con
### PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/{{id}}/deactivate (borrado lógico).
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000

# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

@token = {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.access_token}}
@id = 1

### UPDATE (PUT)
# @name updateCustomerPut
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentType": "CC",
  "documentNumber": "1234567890",
  "name": "Ana Pérez Actualizado",
  "phone": "3011112233",
  "email": "ana.actualizada@example.com"
}

### UPDATE (PATCH)
# @name updateCustomerPatch
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "3011112233",
  "email": "ana.actualizada@example.com"
}
